    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The sphereshaper is particularly talented at investing essence. At 3rd, 9th, and 15th level the essence capacity of all the sphereshaper’s essence receptacles increases by one. In addition, the DC for any of their veil abilities increases by +1 each time they gain this ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sphereshaper#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
